// TEMPLATE: constructor + struct. One struct per product, methods per API.
// When the struct already exists, only append methods.
//
// TEMPLATE: client accessor naming — legacy accessors exist in two styles
// (UseDemoClient without version, UseDemoV20230101Client with version).
